  pp: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e4cda9485b58135488df390d2cb8078a, type: 3}
  title: Mama
  cameraOffset: {x: -0.45, y: 5.32, z: 0}
  startWithPlayer: 0
  talkOnlyOnce: 1
  shouldZoom: 1
  dialogue:
  - you motherfucker
  - mama watch your tounge!
  - fuck you you little bitch, why haven't you visited me these last weeks?
  - you are right mama. I'm sorry. I was really busy with work.
  - don't you dare to leave your mama alone for so long ever again
  - ...
  - is everything fine with work?
  - yeah it's fine
  - do you have money?
  - yes mama
  - give your mama some money?
  - 'okay[addMoney=-200]'
  - '*kiss* I love you my boy'
  - love you too.
